s runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and February to March came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 21% of normal in October to November and 30% in September to October. So far in 2026 it has run 123% in April to May and 70% in May to June. July to August is the wettest pair at 16.64 inches normal, and November to December the driest at 4.19.</p>"}
